  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/skills/trades/construction-mason-bricklayer-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose a point you can see on the ground within range. A fountain of churned earth and stone erupts in a 20-foot cube centered on that point. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 4d12 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Additionally, the ground in that area becomes difficult terrain until cleared away. Each 5-foot-square portion of the area requires at least 1 minute to clear by hand.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you use this creation with a creation slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d12 for each slot level above 3rd.</p>",
